# Enter the Avatar State: until end of turn the target creature you control becomes an Avatar in addition to its other
# types (CR 205.1b) and gains flying, first strike, lifelink and hexproof (CR 611.2a). Bot2 has a creature too, which the
# spell cannot target ("you control", CR 115.1); Bot2's Lightning Bolt cannot target the hexproof Dryad Arbor (CR 702.11b)
# but can target Bot1's other Ornithopter (the positive control). The Arbor's lifelink gains Bot1 a life when it hits;
# on Bot2's turn the effect has ended (CR 514.2) and nothing shows on it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Dryad Arbor
Plains
Plains
Ornithopter
Enter the Avatar State
Plains x3
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x4
Mountain x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Dryad Arbor.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Hand.Enter the Avatar State.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Enter the Avatar State.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Dryad Arbor)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dryad Arbor.Subtypes = Avatar; Dryad; Forest
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dryad Arbor.Keywords = FirstStrike; Flying; Hexproof; Lifelink
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
! Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Dryad Arbor)
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Attack(Dryad Arbor > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Life = 21
? Bot2.Life = 19
[T4 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Dryad Arbor.Subtypes = Dryad; Forest
Bot1.Battlefield.Dryad Arbor.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter = (absent)
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Subtypes = Thopter
